      "writtenOn": "2014-09-25T00:40:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good Question!\n\nAccelerometer is a required sensor on ChromeBook device.\nGyro is a optional sensor.\n\nThis is assume that Accelerometer is init before Gyro. I should document it in the code.\n\nIf a user (board device) only init accelerometer, then the gyro is power down all the time.\n\nIf a user (board device config table) init gyro logic of the same chip, then gyro will get init and power on properly via set_rate().",
      "parentUuid": "f08beba0_a962b88c",
      "revId": "7d40063d46aa9a8b6146355ee9be9db775af7f0d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
